            "如果应用程序在其安装清单上具有正确的权限,情况并非如此。<p>&lt;uses-permission android:name=\"android.permission.INTERNET\" &#x2F;&gt;<p>然后你需要在一个后台应用程序线程上编写服务器处理代码,使用完美工作的服务器套接字。<p>这仅在使用蓝牙的 wlan 或局域网上有效,但谁想要数据调制解调器用于服务器。<p>借助 Gemini 的赞美,<p><pre><code>    import kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers\n    import kotlinx.coroutines.withContext\n    import java.io.BufferedReader\n    import java.io.InputStreamReader\n    import java.net.ServerSocket\n    import java.net.Socket\n    import java.net.SocketException\n\n    class AndroidTcpServer {\n\n        private var serverSocket: ServerSocket? = null\n        private var isRunning = false\n\n        &#x2F;&#x2F; 从 CoroutineScope 调用此函数 (例如,lifecycleScope.launch)\n        async suspend fun startServer(port: Int = 8080) {\n            withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n                try {\n                    serverSocket = ServerSocket(port)\n                    isRunning = true\n                    \n                    &#x2F;&#x2F; 循环以持续接受传入的客户端连接\n                    while (isRunning) {\n                        val clientSocket = serverSocket?.accept() &#x2F;&#x2F; 阻塞直到客户端连接\n                        \n                        if (clientSocket != null) {\n                            &#x2F;&#x2F; 在单独的后台例程中处理每个客户端连接\n                            handleClient(clientSocket)\n                        }\n                    }\n                } catch (e: SocketException) {\n                    &#x2F;&#x2F; 当 stopServer() 关闭套接字时触发\n                    println(\"Server socket closed: ${e.message}\")\n                } catch (e: Exception) {\n                    e.printStackTrace()\n                } finally {\n                    stopServer()\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private suspend fun handleClient(socket: Socket) {\n            withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n                try {\n                    val reader = BufferedReader(InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream()))\n                    val outputStream = socket.getOutputStream()\n\n                    &#x2F;&#x2F; 从客户端读取传入文本\n                    val incomingMessage = reader.readLine()\n                    println(\"Received from client: $incomingMessage\")\n\n                    &#x2F;&#x2F; 向客户端发送简单响应\n                    val response = \"Hello from Android Server!\\n\"\n                    outputStream.write(response.toByteArray())\n                    outputStream.flush()\n\n                } catch (e: Exception) {\n                    e.printStackTrace()\n                } finally {\n                    &#x2F;&#x2F; 始终关闭单个客户端连接\n                    socket.close()\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        fun stopServer() {\n            isRunning = false\n            try {\n                serverSocket?.close()\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                e.printStackTrace()\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n</code></pre>正如你从我的评论历史中可以想象的那样,我是一个让 Android 成为 Android 的粉丝,使用 Android 原生应用程序,而不是将 GNU&#x2F;Linux 塞进 APK 中。",
